      <author>David Barron</author>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>Goal race: <b>Bay Area Half, Thu Oct 15</b>, with Owen. Goal ~1:25 (6:29/mi). Owen wants 1:22.</div><div>Volume 9-11 h/week. Running ~55-62 mi at peak.</div><div><br/></div><table style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>week of</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>hours</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>key sessions</b></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Aug 10</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">9</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">settle in SF. all easy + strides. find a flat loop (Embarcadero?)</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Aug 17</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">9.5</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">threshold 3 x 10' @ 6:15-6:20, long 100'</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Aug 24</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">10</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">hills 8 x 60 s, long 105' w/ last 20' @ 6:45</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Aug 31</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">7 (down)</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">strides only, long 85'</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Sep 7</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">10.5</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">threshold 2 x 15', long 110'</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Sep 14</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">11</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">10 mi @ goal pace rehearsal in race shoes (Sat), long 115' Sun? no — one or the other</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Sep 21</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">10.5</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">5 x 1 mi @ 6:05 w/ 90 s, long 110' with 6 mi @ 6:35</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Sep 28</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">10</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">threshold 3 x 12', long 100'</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Oct 5</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">8</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">UIST talk week (Oct 7). keep it simple: 1 x 4 mi @ 6:25, long 80'</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Oct 12</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">5 + race</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">taper. Tue 4 x 1k @ 6:10 pace. race Thu</td></tr></table><div><br/></div><div>Cycling 2 x 60-75' Z2 when the running is under 8 h. Elliptical unlikely (no gym yet, check the incubator's).</div><div><br/></div><div>8/30 update: Aug 17 + 24 done as written. HR at 6:15 pace on threshold = 172-174. good sign.</div></en-note>]]>
    </content>
  </note>
</en-export>
